abstract: >-
  Code for VAE training, latent-space multivariate data assimilation,
  classical 3D-VAR, BLUE and EnKF baselines, and NEMO/SI3 restart transfer
  used in Variational multivariate data assimilation improves sea-ice
  analysis and forecasting.
